  "guard_summary": "getSafeProperty enforces: 1) object must be plain object (isPlainObject check), 2) property must be own property (Object.hasOwnProperty check), 3) blocks access to constructor method, 4) uses safeMethods whitelist for function properties. Property name is stringified with escaping.",
  "risk_pattern": "User-controlled property names are validated through getSafeProperty's security controls before property access, preventing prototype pollution and unauthorized method access.",
